    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A former high-powered attorney whose 'death' in a staged car accident concealed her Embrace, Robin Withers is Bilé's true favorite childe, sent into the city as Michael Brandeis' publicly acknowledged rival. Her open feud with Michael is calculated to sow distrust of the Ventrue among Toreador, Tremere, and Nosferatu observers, all while she covertly supports her sire's larger plan from what appears to be the opposing side of a Ventrue succession dispute.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Play Robin as a sharp, controlled courtroom mind turned to vampiric politics &mdash; always building a case, always three moves ahead, and entirely comfortable playing the public villain of the piece if it serves the greater scheme. She enjoys the game of rivalry with Michael rather more than strict duty requires.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, convert to owned Discipline Items at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 1, Dominate 3, Obfuscate 2, Presence 2.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: João Bilé (secret). Embrace: 1976. Unaware of Margarida Cordeiro's existence as a fellow childe of Bilé. Part of Sample Brood: Bilé's Gambit, Clanbook: Ventrue, Chapter Three.",
